{"articleNo":"180842","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=180842&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017년 하반기「전주시 대학생 학자금대출 이자지원 」사업 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.09.21","hit":"3220","attachments":[{"name":"현수막(안).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=180842&attachNo=5603"},{"name":"학자금 대출이자 지원사업 안내문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=180842&attachNo=5677"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전주시에서는 관내 대학생들이 경제적 여건에 관계없이 의지와 능력에따라 학업에 전념할 수 있는 환경 조성을 위해 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전주시 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원 사업 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">을 추진하고 있으니 해당학생은 참고바랍니다.</span>&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">1</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">사업개요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">사 업 명 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전주시 대학생 학자금대출 이자 지원 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원대상 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전주시에 주민등록을 한 전국 대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: